// Table Scope (D343, build R3): the choice above My day and Work queue, whose work they show. "Mine and free" (the
// first, chosen when the page opens): the lines assigned to the manager who opens the report (Team[Me]) and the lines
// nobody has; "Everyone": the work of the whole team. No relationship: the measures read the choice (Everyone chosen).
#table(type table [Choice = text, Order = Int64.Type], {{"Mine and free", 1}, {"Everyone", 2}})
